9WhkvICysXhEDKpChnMse5t3A3D4IHeV-1pGXn2VdxA&oe=6AFC9193"}, {"file_name": "05_Final_Swarm.png", "id": "950679394131611", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499292426_950679397464944_7481355984595306273_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RxcM3WD2rHgQ7kNvwGCdKV5&_nc_oc=AdoZUoqYXMmlvFUiOP9W499_6WqvCJT3Hfm3x7IIOlRHlqD7ZmaZVGyrGIYFi3pUevo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQZ6CC5KW9xzigajj7AVE16shApXaku5r46o6UuyUvnGw&oe=6AFC8361"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Weenie Baneenie: Free Demo", "keywords": [], "long_description": "A giant hero. A beautiful little world. One very sore loser.\nStoic Stinky placed third in a galactic dance contest. He did not take it well. Now his army is sweeping across the universe, and everyone is going to dance to his rhythm. Everyone except you.\nYou are Weenie Baneenie: a once-ordinary guy who built a beautiful world and, over 100,000 years, became its enormous hot-dog-shaped defender. See through his eyes, raise both hands, and protect the home you love.\nThis is tower defense where YOU are the tower.\nUnleash palm blasts and lasers as flying enemies pour from the sky. Slam toward incoming threats, watch your front and rear shields, and manage your weapons as the swarms close in. You are powerful. Stinky\u2019s answer is overwhelming numbers.\n- Fight with both hands using independently aimed palm blasters and lasers.\n- Defend a whimsical world of lush hills, rocky cliffs, and towering skies.\n- Face Bo Mellow\u2019s pulse attacks, then hold out against the final horde.\n- Choose Easy, Medium, or Hard.\nThis free single-player demo introduces Weenie\u2019s story and a battle you can replay. It is not the full campaign or the final showdown with Stinky.\nFeedback is welcome! Tell us what you enjoyed, what confused you, and what you\u2019d like to see next.\nControllers required. Play seated or standing in place, with right-stick snap turning.\nProtect your world. Keep the universe free.", "short_description": "What is our future? AI turns out great for 100,000 years. Then one quiet day Stoic Stinky lost his dance competition. Weenie Baneenie is the only hope for everyone! Blast flying swarms, defend your little world, and face Bo Mellow in this free action demo."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.exodusstar.com/weenie-baneenie-privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Exodus Star", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.exodusstar.com/weenie-baneenie", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1430275670158355"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298150_1739134413964327_8256510822962497963_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CVYgZYteDNwQ7kNvwF5MPAw&_nc_oc=AdqGy41vthdEukQcbh1LPg45-wmC1j-s3maYWGXX2wUBgSzMWPfng5FvMc3fRm9rZqU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSaOl2AI4Bbt69fVhcFMavR1m9Heok17cPXLbwIK7-kLw&oe=6AFC8201"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Weenie Baneenie: Free 